  "item.the-roots-of-ancient-magic.air_staff.description": "Creates a powerful vortex that pulls nearby creatures toward the target point and launches them upward. Costs 10 Mana.",
  "item.the-roots-of-ancient-magic.aqua_staff.description": "Creates a sphere of water surrounded by ice at the targeted location. Costs 10 Mana.",
  "item.the-roots-of-ancient-magic.dark_staff.description": "Releases a dark shockwave, knocks enemies back and grants invisibility and speed. Costs 6 Mana.",
  "item.the-roots-of-ancient-magic.earth_staff.description": "Creates a protective stone sphere at the targeted location. Costs 10 Mana.",
  "item.the-roots-of-ancient-magic.fire_staff.description": "Launches a powerful fireball that explodes on impact. Costs 10 Mana.",
  "item.the-roots-of-ancient-magic.light_staff.description": "Teleports you up to 50 blocks in the direction you are looking. Costs 10 Mana.",

