  "item.the-roots-of-ancient-magic.elemental_robe.description": "A magical robe attuned to the power of the elements.",

  "item.the-roots-of-ancient-magic.elemental_sword.description": "A weapon infused with elemental power. Each element grants a chance to unleash a unique effect.",
  "item.the-roots-of-ancient-magic.elemental_hoe.description": "Harvests and replants crops using the power of its element.",
  "item.the-roots-of-ancient-magic.elemental_axe.description": "A magical axe that can fell entire sections of trees and may grant an elemental blessing.",

  "item.the-roots-of-ancient-magic.heroic_sword.description": "A legendary sword that grants Strength and Fire Resistance. Strikes ignite and slow enemies.",
  "item.the-roots-of-ancient-magic.heroic_axe.description": "A mighty axe that grants Speed and Resistance. Normal strikes launch enemies upward, while critical hits stun them.",
  "item.the-roots-of-ancient-magic.heroic_pickaxe.description": "A powerful pickaxe that grants Haste and Night Vision. Mines a large area and digs a tunnel.",
  "item.the-roots-of-ancient-magic.heroic_shovel.description": "A powerful shovel that grants Haste and Jump Boost. Clears a large area and digs forward.",
  "item.the-roots-of-ancient-magic.heroic_hoe.description": "A legendary farming tool that grants Luck and extra absorption. Harvests and replants crops over a wide area."
